# Context & File Length Caps

1. Code files: capped at 250 lines (evaluate.js capped at 400).
2. Agent files: AGENTS.md capped at 150 lines; rules and subagents capped at 80 lines; workflows capped at 50 lines.
3. Documentation: capped at 200 lines per file (modular docs under `docs/`).
